# ── Logs ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Logs are ignored by default, BUT results/logs/ is tracked deliberately. Those
# files are the evidence behind the numbers quoted in the README; before
# 2026-09-03 a blanket *.log rule meant none of them were in the repository and
# every claim would have been unverifiable to anyone who cloned it.
*.log
!results/logs/
!results/logs/**

